<!--
    CNC-L (docs/tickets/centre-notifications-complet.md, 5.2, decision of the PM of 2026-11-19): the logo of Miff as the round picture of a line of the centre of notifications, when the line
    is about the whole Miff or about nobody who can be named: the glyph "M + i + heart" of ic_launcher_foreground.xml (the same two paths, to the digit) on a disc #043CD1. No rounded
    square, no mask of the system: the icon of the app cannot be used as it is; this is the glyph alone, on a round that the screen clips like every other avatar.
    The glyph is drawn LARGER here than in the adaptive icon (x1.3, centred on the disc, its farthest corner at 80 % of the radius): at 40 dp the heart of the icon would shrink to a dot,
    this one stays a heart of about 8 dp. Blue, white and yellow-green read on the light and the dark theme alike: no night variant. Decorative for the screen reader (the line says who).
    The two glyph paths must stay identical to the ones of ic_launcher_foreground.xml (CenterLogoTest enforces it).
-->
